  "briefing": "An uncharted frontier sector, different every time. Raiders have dug in somewhere on the far side; the Ceres Free Traders hold a port of their own. At peace with you, at war with the raiders.\n\n[b]Goal:[/b] destroy the raiders and take their planets. The campaign ends when one faction stands alone, or when nobody is left at war (then the highest empire score wins).\n\n[b]Scout first.[/b] Planets may have traits worth fighting for, and the sector is littered with discoveries: derelicts, signals, caches. The first fleet in claims them.\n\n[b]Controls[/b]: click a fleet, then a blue hex. [b]E[/b] Empire, [b]H[/b] Heroes, [b]D[/b] detach ships, [b]Space[/b] end turn, [b]Esc[/b] menu.",
